      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعصّىِ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (an affair) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, difficult;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِعْتَاصَ</span>: (K, TA:) said by some to be originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَصَّصَ</span>; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَظَنَّى</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَضَّى</span>. (TA.)

